5. What is the function of the Echo pin?
Answer:
The Echo pin receives the reflected ultrasonic waves and provides the pulse duration to the Arduino.
________________________________________
6. Which Arduino function is used to measure the echo pulse duration?
Answer:
The pulseIn() function is used to measure the duration of the echo pulse.
